-	The game $\mathcal G^{\mathrm{ld}}_{\mathsf{ldparams}}$ is the typed game with type set $\mathcal T^{\mathrm{ld}}$, the question distribution of Definition~\ref{def:ld-question-distribution}, and win predicate $D^{\mathrm{ld}}_{\mathsf{ldparams}}$.
